U(x,y;z)=\frac{e^{ikz}e^{ik(x^2+y^2)/(2z)}}{i\lambda z}
\iint U_A(x',y')e^{ik(x'^2+y'^2)/(2z)}
e^{-i2\pi(xx'+yy')/(\lambda z)}dx'\,dy'.
\tag*{[1]}
\]

